cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AGROLATTICE in research, please cite the archived AGROLATTICE 11.19 Publication Reference Release and the associated platform paper when available."
title: "AGROLATTICE: Publication Reference Release"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Pavlou"
    given-names: "Achilleas"
    affiliation: "University of Nicosia"
version: "11.19"
date-released: "2026-08-12"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - agricultural informatics
  - digital twin
  - precision agriculture
  - crop modelling
  - remote sensing
  - GxExM
  - maize
  - field experiments
  - scientific reproducibility
abstract: >-
  AGROLATTICE is a spatial agricultural intelligence and persistent digital-twin
  platform integrating field geometry, climate and weather, soil-water state,
  Earth observation, sensors, crop physiology, management, experiments,
  predictive models, validation, recommendations, outcomes and reproducible
  research reporting. Version 11.19 is the frozen publication-reference release.
